**W006** · Behavior missing category

behavior 'login' has no category — agents use category for task routing

A `behavior` entity has no `category` field, which agents rely on for task routing. Add a `category` field to the behavior.

[Documentation](https://github.com/leaderiop/SpecForge/blob/main/docs/diagnostics.md#w006)

